<title>USA: ITEX says names Graham Norris chairman.</title>
<headline>ITEX says names Graham Norris chairman.</headline>
<dateline>PORTLAND, Ore. 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>ITEX Corp said its shareholders named Graham Norris as chairman of the company during the company's recently held annual meeting.</p>
<p>ITEX operates the nation's largest barter exchange, the company said.</p>
<p>Officials from the company were not immediately available to comment.</p>
